@startuml
' Activity F-11 Perangkat — docs/proposal/05-activity.md §5.11
start
:Registrasi device + lab + profile;
fork
  :Provision bearer sekali pakai;
  :Rotate token + overlap singkat;
fork again
  :Update registry atau lab assignment;
fork again
  :Jeda atau aktifkan kamera:\nmatching berhenti, heartbeat jalan;
fork again
  :Nonaktif: revoke kredensial + kamera offline;
end fork
stop

note right
  ADMIN saja (MANAGE_MASTER_DATA untuk registry/
  kredensial; MANAGE_SETTINGS untuk kamera).
  Heartbeat/discovery/gallery memakai DEVICE_OPERATE.
  409: device_inactive, deployment_profile_mismatch,
  device_camera_disabled.
end note

note left
  Jalur operasi kontinu (LABORANT + device):
  Heartbeat + camera_status + metrik
  -> Discover sesi aktif lab ini
  -> Tarik gallery + kirim recognition-event.
end note
@enduml
